Hold them off a bit longer.

302
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,440
Coach,

303
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,880
is this really going to work?

304
00:19:05,839 --> 00:19:06,720
We have to try.

305
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,559
What if it works?

306
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:15,680
Sorry,

307
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,519
just a moment longer.

308
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,319
Oh, no.

309
00:19:21,519 --> 00:19:22,440
I didn't bring my jersey.

310
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,319
Where did I put it?

311
00:19:23,599 --> 00:19:24,160
I'll go get it.

312
00:19:24,279 --> 00:19:25,119
No need.

313
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:30,680
Xie Yizhou?

314
00:19:31,359 --> 00:19:32,359
Why are you here?

315
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:34,440
I made a bet with them.

316
00:19:34,599 --> 00:19:36,000
If you came today,

317
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,400
I would give you back the jersey.

318
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,319
If you didn't,

319
00:19:39,519 --> 00:19:40,960
they'd keep it as a souvenir.

320
00:19:43,039 --> 00:19:43,720
Sorry,

321
00:19:43,839 --> 00:19:45,640
but you need to give it back now.

322
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:47,799
It was meant for you.

323
00:20:24,599 --> 00:20:25,440
Come on, sign it.

324
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,200
Don't waste time.

325
00:20:34,279 --> 00:20:35,039
Coach,

326
00:20:35,519 --> 00:20:36,400
I'm late.

327
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:37,720
Not at all.

328
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,400
Come on.

329
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,119
Yibei!

330
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:43,200
Victory!

331
00:20:48,359 --> 00:20:52,119
Yibei, come on!

332
00:20:52,119 --> 00:20:55,319
No. 5 High School, come on!

333
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,960
25 seconds left.

334
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,119
No. 5 High School is leading by two points

335
00:20:59,119 --> 00:21:00,920
and has possession of the ball.

336
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:02,480
Meanwhile,

337
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,359
Yibei is

338
00:21:03,359 --> 00:21:05,400
on the edge of the cliff.

339
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:06,480
Who will

340
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,799
be the biggest dark horse

341
00:21:07,799 --> 00:21:09,960
in this year's league?

342
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:11,079
Let's find out.

343
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,039
Alright.

344
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:12,880
The ball is served.

345
00:21:13,559 --> 00:21:14,799
It's passed the halfway line smoothly.

346
00:21:16,039 --> 00:21:17,160
Trying to move the ball to the basket.

347
00:21:18,119 --> 00:21:18,920
Chen Song

348
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:20,240
makes a crucial steal.

349
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,200
The ball is stolen.

350
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,599
They got the ball.

351
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,559
Yibei's small lineup today

352
00:21:24,559 --> 00:21:26,200
is truly mind-boggling.

353
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,920
Can they create a miracle?

354
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:28,920
Okay.

355
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:30,000
The ball goes to Lin Qingyuan.

356
00:21:30,079 --> 00:21:30,720
Lin Qingyuan makes

357
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,160
a beautiful back-elbow pass.

358
00:21:32,359 --> 00:21:33,880
Gu Chenyang tries a three-pointer.

359
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,000
It's in.

360
00:21:47,279 --> 00:21:48,519
The ball's in!

361
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,839
Gu Chenyang's nailed the game-winning shot!

362
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:53,039
69 to 68!

363
00:21:53,519 --> 00:21:54,720
They did it!

364
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,839
They did it!

365
00:21:55,839 --> 00:21:57,960
Yibei Middle School pulled off the comeback!

366
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:00,440
They've truly made a miracle!

367
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:01,880
Let's congratulate

368
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:05,279
Yibei Middle School on the game-winning shot!
